packaging_reference.effects:
Runs python_scripts/fomod-info.py to write fomod/info.xml from fomod-source;
removes existing versions/SkyrimNet_DOM ${VERSION}.zip if present;
packs fomod, Scripts, SkyrimNet_DOM.esp, SKSE into that zip via 7z.

packaging_reference.prereqs:
Scripts/*.pex current if Papyrus changed (compile via skyrimse.ppj / pyro;
do not modify Diary of Mine scripts). Zip must include full SKSE/ (actions,
prompts, items, triggers) — not scripts-only.
